WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A synthetic text receipt opens beside its editable purchase fields.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Local extraction recognized the item and amount. The owner adds the notebook’s grid-paper detail.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
In the verified model run, €12.45 became 12 minor units. The owner corrected it to 1245 before confirming.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Saving creates a purchase. Reloading the vault retrieves the confirmed record.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.000
This synthetic policy grants 30 calendar days from November 24 in UTC. The assessment shows when the window closes.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:57.000
