00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:31.000
The promised delivery date passed. The owner’s evidence records that receipt is still unconfirmed.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:39.000
The worker opened an evidence-linked case. Its source and reason are available alongside the draft.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:49.000
