00:01:49.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Select original receipt attachments. A redaction changes the letter only. Selected files retain their original bytes.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Review the exact recipient, letter and attachment identities. Approval authorizes one download.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:20.000
The actual JSON download succeeds. The case records exported not sent. The merchant has received no message.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:27.000
The local capture test repeated the export request with the consumed approval. The API rejected it.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:36.000
Open the revisions to see the earlier processing status and its source. The overdue refund is disputed.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:44.000
The ordinary worker delivered this reminder after the disposable follow-up deadline was advanced.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:52.000
The journal records the recovery actions and the unsent export.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:03:01.000
The restarted private Sprite served the same purchase and receipt bytes. Independent cold-private-Sprite wake remains unverified.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:08.000
Historical Node test output from the accepted application baseline.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:16.000
